OL,3,GNEWSAThree attempted murder arrests
OL,4,Aafter two separate stabbings
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree people have been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of attempted murder after two
OL,8,Fseparate stabbings in Newry and Lurgan.
OL,10,FIn the Newry incident, police say they
OL,11,Fwere called to a house in the Woodhill
OL,12,Farea after 06:00 BST on Sunday, where a
OL,13,Fman with stab wounds was found inside.
OL,15,FAnd a man in his 40s is in a serious
OL,16,Fcondition in hospital after he was
OL,17,Fstabbed in the back at a property in
OL,18,Fthe Grattan Street area of Lurgan on
OL,19,FSunday afternoon.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
