OL,3,GNEWSAThree attempted murder arrests
OL,4,Aafter two separate stabbings
OL,5,
OL,6,FArmed response officers were sent to
OL,7,Fthe scene. The suspect, a 34-year-old
OL,8,Fman, was arrested a short distance
OL,9,Faway.
